Patch 0005 (fid-num-reductions) of fid-clarabel, spec node KRN.SOLV.CONIC.PATCH.

Route sums, dot products and 2-norms through fid_num::red (fixed block-and-tree compensated summation, no FMA); use the bounds-checked symmetric matrix-vector product instead of the unsafe copy.

Rule IDs and rationale: vendor/fid-clarabel/AUDIT.toml.

